   "fontFamily": 2,
   "fontSize": 17,
   "text": "The wallet audit trail: every change to one customer’s wallet, read-only, built from the wireframe kit.\nIt shows the customer you are acting as. Sample text is real data (User-7adb5d92) from the seeded database.\nDates are Indian calendar days; both ends are included.",
